conversation-thankforhealing-line-0 = I wanted to thank you for tending to my wounds. I owe you my life
conversation-thankforhealing-line-1 = It was my duty. We must look after each other here
conversation-thankforhealing-line-2 = The fever has broken, and I can move without such pain
conversation-thankforhealing-line-3 = Rest still for a day or two. Let the herbs do their work fully

conversation-checkonpatient-line-0 = How are you feeling today? Does the wound trouble you?
conversation-checkonpatient-line-1 = Much better, thanks to you. The swelling has gone down
conversation-checkonpatient-line-2 = Keep the bandage clean and change it when it dampens
conversation-checkonpatient-line-3 = I will. Your care has been a blessing

conversation-smalltalk01-line-0 = Fair weather today, wouldn't you say?
conversation-smalltalk01-line-1 = Aye, a fine day. May it stay this calm till dusk
conversation-smalltalk01-line-2 = Have you heard any news from the nearby villages?
conversation-smalltalk01-line-3 = Only rumors, friend. But rumors keep the world turning

conversation-smalltalk02-line-0 = Greetings. Roads seem quieter than usual
conversation-smalltalk02-line-1 = Quiet roads are a blessing. Means fewer troubles wandering about
conversation-smalltalk02-line-2 = Any advice for a traveler passing through?
conversation-smalltalk02-line-3 = Keep your purse close, your boots dry, and never ignore a warm hearth
conversation-smalltalk02-line-4 = Sounds like wisdom earned the hard way
conversation-smalltalk02-line-5 = In these lands, that's the only way wisdom comes

conversation-greetingcasual-line-0 = Hello there, friend
conversation-greetingcasual-line-1 = Good day to you! How goes your work?
conversation-greetingcasual-line-2 = I'm well, thank you. The weather favors us today
conversation-greetingcasual-line-3 = That it does. May your labors be light

conversation-morninggreeting-line-0 = Good morning. How did you sleep?
conversation-morninggreeting-line-1 = Not bad, thank you. Hope the day will be peaceful

conversation-smalltalkrejected-line-0 = Good day! How are you this morning?
conversation-smalltalkrejected-line-1 = Not now

conversation-smalltalkignored-line-0 = The weather's turned, hasn't it? Colder today
conversation-smalltalkignored-line-1 = uh
conversation-smalltalkignored-line-2 = Are you well? You seem troubled
conversation-smalltalkignored-line-3 = Leave me be

conversation-smalltalkrude-line-0 = Working hard, I see. Need a hand
conversation-smalltalkrude-line-1 = What I need is for people to mind their own business
conversation-smalltalkrude-line-2 = I only meant to help. No need for harsh words
conversation-smalltalkrude-line-3 = Then help by walking away
